  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 8.0.2:\n\n## Fixed\n- Incorrect handling/redacting of layers represented by FormXObject's. (DOC-6730, DOC-6734)\n- Export to images may produce incorrect results if SaveAsImageOptions.Zoom is not 1. (DOC-6723)\n- Export of PDFs containing zero width lines may produce images with jagged appearance. (DOC-6736)",
